Overview
This project showcases an interactive Power BI dashboard analyzing Amazon's global sales data from 2012 to 2015. The dashboard highlights key metrics and insights related to sales, returns, profits, and market performance.

Key Insights
Sales Projection: 12.64M units with 51.29K product units sold.
KPI: 178K with 51.29K returns.
Sales by Segment: Home Office (51.48%), Corporate (30.25%), Consumer (18.27%).
Sales by Region: Europe (31.98%), Africa (26%), USCA (18.7%).
Top Product Profit: Canon Imaging leads with 25K ₹ in profit.
Top Losses: Major losses from Cubify and Lexmark products.

Tools Used
Power BI: For data visualization and dashboard creation.
Power BI Editor: For data transformation and modeling.

Focus Areas
Year-wise sales comparison
Regional market analysis
Product performance and customer profitability
